=== SIGNATURE ===
set_u(a, b, [as_row])

=== COMMENT ===
Set union: all distinct values from set a and set b combined.

=== CODE ===
=LAMBDA(val_a, val_b, [as_row],
   set(VSTACK(val_a, val_b), z_opt(0, as_row))
)

=== DESCRIPTION ===
Set union of two ranges.

Arguments:
  a        - first range/set.
  b        - second range/set.
  [as_row] - 1 for a horizontal result; default 0 vertical.

Optional arguments: a blank cell or "" behaves like omitting the argument (the default applies), and a number given as text ("2") is accepted as the number (z_opt).

Returns:
  The cleaned, sorted values found in either a or b.

Example:
  set_u(A1:A5, B1:B5)
